<title>PHILIPPINES: Zeus says Q3 net loss 50.828 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Zeus says Q3 net loss 50.828 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeus Holdings Corp, formerly JR Garments Corp, said on Tuesday it posted a net loss of 50.828 million pesos in the third quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>Net sales amounted to 62.591 million pesos, while cost of goods reached 44.077 million pesos.</p>
<p>Operating expenses totalled 57.113 million pesos.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not available.</p>
<p>Zeus has transformed itself into a holding company.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
